<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoHeader"><a name="_Hlk144985533"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;
font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">***CC
current AM/ABM above***</span></b></a><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Dear <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">[Name],</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Hello! I am so excited
to be your new <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Account
Manager/Area Booking Manager [Remove if not applicable]</span>. As shared
previously, we have realigned some regions and contacts in order to better
align Red Cross lines of service and improve operations. Thank you so much for
your flexibility throughout this transition.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I am thrilled to start
working with you, one of our trusted partners, to continue ensuring blood
drives are filling calendars, donors are coming in the doors and patients are
getting the lifesaving blood products they need. I promise to keep you informed
of all changes and provide support to make this transition as smooth as
possible.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Here’s what you need to
know:<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:red"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I will work closely
with you just as <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Current
AM/ABM&gt;</span> did to recruit donors and ensure strong blood drives. There
is no action needed on your part.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">In the meantime, if you
have any questions, please don’t hesitate to contact me. I can’t wait to start
working together and look forward to our partnership! Thank you for your
continued support.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-themecolor:
text1;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;New AM/ABM Signature&gt;</span></span><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<div style="mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;padding:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in">

<p class="MsoHeader" style="border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;
padding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Please see previous
messages below for reference:<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

</div>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I wanted to check in
regarding the announcement about our geographical changes coming in January. As
previously shared, we are realigning some districts and regions to better
connect Red Cross lines of service.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">While these changes do
not impact most processes and procedures, some areas will see alterations to
Account Managers/<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Area
Booking Managers [Remove if not applicable]</span>. Our region is one of those
impacted by the realignment. Rest assured, while any adjustment can be
challenging at first, we will continue to keep you informed and supported. I
very much appreciate your support throughout this transition.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I’ve copied my
colleague, <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;New AM/ABM
Name&gt;</span>, who is excited to build upon our relationship in the future!
They will continue to keep you updated on these changes. Please don’t hesitate
to reach out to either of us with any questions.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank you for your
continued commitment to helping provide lifesaving blood for patients in need.
We could not fulfill our mission without you!<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-themecolor:
text1;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Current AM/ABM Signature&gt;</span></span><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:
yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;mso-themecolor:
text1;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;New AM/ABM Signature&gt;</span></span><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<div style="mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;
mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;padding:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in">

<p class="MsoHeader" style="border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext .75pt;
padding:0in;mso-padding-alt:0in 0in 1.0pt 0in"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

</div>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I wanted to give you a
heads up on some exciting changes we are making in the new year to better align
Red Cross operations. The changes will define a common set of geographic
boundaries for both Biomedical and Humanitarian Services, further strengthening
our organization and improving mission delivery.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Background<o:p></o:p></span></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">For decades, the
American Red Cross Humanitarian Services lines of business (Disaster Cycle
Services, Services to the Armed Forces, Training Services and International
Services) have not been geographically aligned with Biomedical Services.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:
Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Humanitarian
Services completed their region transition to the new geographic boundaries in
summer 2020. The final step in this process is for Biomedical Services to
transition to the new, aligned regional, district and territory boundaries.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader" style="margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style="font-size:
10.0pt;font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:
Symbol"><span style="mso-list:Ignore">·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Working
together in aligned geographies, leadership across these lines of services will
be more closely linked, allowing improved coordination, robust partnerships,
integrated activities and shared resources to more effectively meet the needs
of communities we serve.<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>

<span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985533"></span>

<p class="MsoHeader"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Impact<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">In
many cases, this transition will be largely invisible to our Blood Program
Leaders. In others, they will see changes in Account Manager/<span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Area Booking Manager [Remove if
not applicable]</span>. If this applies to you, rest assured because our team
will follow up in the upcoming months. This geographical realignment will <b>not</b>
change our mission, our commitment to you, or the day-to-day operations of
recruiting blood donors and hosting drives. It is a way to enhance connections
within our organization, our trusted partners and our donors.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><b><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">What’s
Next<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">This
message is for awareness; there is nothing you need to do. You’re in good hands
with <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span>
and <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">&lt;Name&gt;</span> as
your <span style="background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow">Area Booking Manager</span>
and Account Manager. We are so grateful for your support of our lifesaving
mission!<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">If
you have any questions, please don’t hesitate to reach out.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_Hlk74312011"></a><a name="_Hlk144985593"><span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk74312011"><span style="font-size:10.0pt;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></a></p>

<span style="mso-bookmark:_Hlk144985593"></span>

